  "releaseNotes": "v3.0.0: Added streaming downloads (GetObjectStreamAsync); configurable upload integrity (payload signing / checksum validation); startup options validation; cancellation now propagates as OperationCanceledException. Breaking: response models are now init-only immutable, request models use the 'required' keyword, and content-carrying request types no longer implement IDisposable (callers own their streams). See CHANGELOG.md.",
